%% YorkLanes — Google OAuth + session cookie
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Web as apps/web origin
  participant API as apps/api
  participant Google as Google OAuth
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres

  User->>Web: GET /login
  User->>Web: click Sign in with Google
  Web->>API: GET /api/auth/google?returnTo=/dashboard
  API->>Google: redirect authorization
  Google-->>User: consent screen
  User->>Google: approve
  Google->>Web: GET /api/auth/google/callback?code=...
  Web->>API: proxy callback
  API->>Google: exchange code for tokens
  Google-->>API: id_token + profile
  API->>DB: UPSERT users
  API->>API: create session yorklanes.sid
  API-->>Web: Set-Cookie + redirect /dashboard
  Web-->>User: dashboard HTML
  Note over Web,API: Browser sends cookie on same origin\nWeb SSR forwards Cookie to API_INTERNAL_URL
